	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_gui_stalker_id_page_description">
		<text>Centered name, rank, and faction icon when looking near stalkers. Always tries an exact camera look-ray first, then soft aim within the aim radius (optional LOS). Bushes block both. Hipfire: both 100m. Binoculars: both 200m. Other ADS/zoom: exact 200m, soft still 100m. Living hostile and zombified names are red. Leader line: living non-hostiles normally, all living stalkers in binoculars — never on corpses. Losing target fades out over 2 seconds. Disable Identification UI (CrookR) and Crook's Identification UI Fix.</text>
	</string>

